{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gnomes on The Roam is set in a world where a race of interdimensional gnomes that feed off sunlight have come to our world seeking our sunlight whether we like it or not. Their world has become uninhabitable as the Gnomes have harnessed and taken all of the energy from their sun causing it to extinguish. In true gnome fashion they decided to use the remaining sun power they had to travel dimensions to ours, they may not have come in peace, but we will send them back in pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022150/extras/acdf3c59ccf2271516fbe573111b1a07.avif?t=1762954048\" width=1526 height=894 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gnomes on the Roam is an infinite horde survival game where you have to defend yourself against the gnome onslaught. Use Plants to help you along your quest and find a way to harness the power of the sun to send them back to where they came from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022150/extras/291148d72e3e608b8a4f2a1121b979c3.avif?t=1762954048\" width=1526 height=894 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite rounds - see how long you can survive against an endless swarm of gnomes that all want you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weapons - find an upgrade both a pistol and an assault rifle within the game to help arm yourself against the gnomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >plants - Find and plant seeds around the map to create plants that will assist you in your mission\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easter egg - There is a secret way to win the game if you can harness the suns power, can you find it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://sha